# Claude Code runtime state. ~/.claude is a symlink into this repo, so anything
# the CLI writes at runtime lands in the working tree. daemon/ holds a control
# key, uploads/ holds pasted images, feedback/drafts/ holds unsent feedback
# payloads that quote session and request ids — none of them belongs in git.
